	"VersionName": "0.1",
	"FriendlyName": "GSTN Mode: Levels",
	"Description": "Levels mode (M12 G6, a Game Feature of the mode framework): ordered level set (UGSTN_LevelSetDefinition), data-driven score rules (UGSTN_ScoreRules), goal zone (one alive player starts a grace timer, the level finishes when it ends), team collectible counting, friendly fire on by default, a placeholder results screen and seamless travel to the next level. Ties GSTNRespawn (shared lives and checkpoints) and GSTNMission together as sibling pieces of one GameRules asset; it never depends on another mode.",
